(text "R0.3: J9 = GND / VCC / OUT. Assembly A: R9=R10=49.9k. Assembly B (0..3V AFE): R9=10k, R10=DNP.\nWio connects to XIAO through B2B ONLY. Never bridge Wio left row to XIAO D0-D5.\n16 SPS + RC reduces ripple, not DC input-loading error; see Analog_calculations_ru.md.\nPCB is a reviewed prototype design. Mechanical fit and powered tests remain required." (at 20 510 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid a1f53fab-1db7-5a1a-9377-3d15d00b316d)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))